":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Citizens familiar with the art of barter, often found scavenging the ruins. They hope to find things in the garbage dumps to tide them over through tough times.","abilities":["Can equip gear, max 1"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":5200,"atk":210,"def":150,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"goggles_gang_thug":{"slug":"goggles_gang_thug","name":"'Goggles' Gang Thug","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Goggles' Gang Thug.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"With factories shutting down and nowhere else to go, young workers started forming gangs. The improvised weapons they use seem somewhat familiar. Maybe from the anti-Sarkaz resistance?","abilities":["Can equip gear, max 1","After several attacks, charges up before attacking, increasing ATK and stealing gear equipped by Operators"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.85,"stats":{"hp":4800,"atk":410,"def":220,"res":15,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.6}},"assault_arts_unit":{"slug":"assault_arts_unit","name":"Assault Arts Unit","icon":"/enemies-icons/Assault Arts Unit.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Standard-issue staff components produced by Londinium's factories, not yet sent to the assembly line. Often malfunctions, but better than letting an Infected cast Arts with their bare hands.","abilities":["When equipped by allied Operators","For a short time after activating their skills, Operators equipped with this deal additional Arts damage and inflict Frighten for a fixed duration when dealing damage","When equipped by enemies","Attacks by units equipped with this deal Arts damage; the first attack after pickup prevents the target from attacking or healing for a period of time","Obtains a Barrier","Gear is lost when Barrier is broken"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"neighborhood_watch_leader":{"slug":"neighborhood_watch_leader","name":"'Neighborhood Watch' Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Neighborhood Watch' Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The leader of an illegal organization formed by citizens to defend their neighborhood by any means. Can often be found apologizing at their opponents' homes after a tussle.","abilities":["Can equip gear, max 1","When equipped with gear, DEF increases","After several attacks, charges up for a splash damage attack"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1100,"def":1350,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"freight_car":{"slug":"freight_car","name":"Freight Car","icon":"/enemies-icons/Freight Car.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"The pride of Victoria's industrial automation, vastly improving transport efficiency between factories. Its designers traded defense for speed, trusting in Londinium's peace and stability.","abilities":["Unblockable; can be attacked by enemies","Drops gear in the surrounding area when defeated and stuns all nearby units; resumes movement after a period of time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.45,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":0,"def":150,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":10}},"heavy_transport_vessel":{"slug":"heavy_transport_vessel","name":"Heavy Transport Vessel","ico